":"本研究在启动前须经各研究中心伦理委员会审查批准。伦理委员会的审查范围包括研究方案及其修订、知情同意书、用于招募受试者的招募材料、以及提供给受试者的任何书面材料。主要研究者同意依照本方案实施本项临床试验，同时遵守《药物临床试验质量管理规范》及《赫尔辛基宣言》，在获得伦理委员会书面批准及受试者书面知情同意之后方可实施该临床试验。研究进行期间，方案修订、严重不良事件及其他可能影响受试者安全和继续参加研究的事项，须按法规要求向伦理委员会报告。","rationale":"公司语料提供伦理委员会审查范围（方案及修订、知情同意书、招募材料、书面材料）及主要研究者承诺遵守GCP与赫尔辛基宣言的监管共性结构。项目已确认多中心设计，各中心均须伦理审批。伦理委员会具体名称、组成、审查频率、年度持续审查安排、快速审查适用条件等实施细节缺少项目级来源，已列入待确认项。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_f738c43b16eb_71f14b624a7a565d","section_number":"11.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:e0de9d5881496ed5e3e55128","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_24ae925c5f71136af903:r6:2324e1714eed68be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:665025df83658b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:9939b9aa574982","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:1e80f33ff07300","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:eb9da1374976e3"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"b2b59a5cd9cc00b7a6ec5ca3c9eef0778dc0585733163b59e49c76bf7c5899bc","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_f738c43b16eb_cddf6069d94acdfa:full-draft:e0de9d5881496ed5e3e55128","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:e0de9d5881496ed5e3e55128","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:db9e2160842cb61e13e728128f749f9e5d2f83cc6d60fa35f8ce6f52a79c1352:e0de9d5881496ed5e3e55128","text_sha256":"b2b59a5cd9cc00b7a6ec5ca3c9eef0778dc0585733163b59e49c76bf7c5899bc"},{"content_sha256":"9d5acf701fc24d461aa8f13015397fcaa97575cf704bd83033a411b2b260322a","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_24ae925c5f71136af903:revision:6","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_24ae925c5f71136af903:r6:2324e1714eed68be","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_24ae925c5